{
    "name":  "Helped - Interview Calendar and Sheet Sync",
    "metadata":  {
                     "instant":  true,
                     "version":  1,
                     "scenario":  {
                                      "roundtrips":  1,
                                      "maxErrors":  3,
                                      "autoCommit":  true,
                                      "autoCommitTriggerLast":  true,
                                      "sequential":  false,
                                      "confidential":  true,
                                      "dataloss":  false,
                                      "dlq":  false
                                  },
                     "notes":  [
                                   "Dedicated interview invitation pipeline for MAKE_WEBHOOK_URL_INTERVIEW_PIPELINE. Creates a private Calendar event, emails the candidate through Calendar guest notifications, writes one Google Sheets row, and returns the event id/URL and row number to the website. A video meeting URL must be supplied by the website or verified in the Calendar module output; this blueprint does not guarantee Google Meet generation. Reschedules update the saved Calendar event and existing sheet row. Reconnect Google Calendar and Google Sheets and select the agency calendar/spreadsheet after import.",
                                   "Router filters are mutually exclusive: new interview when calendarEventId is empty; reschedule existing row when calendarEventId and sheetRowNumber are nonempty; legacy reschedule when calendarEventId is nonempty and sheetRowNumber is empty. Verify filters after import. Do not run a live booking just to detect webhook data because Calendar may notify guests.",
                                   "The Worker sends scheduledAt as an ISO 8601 UTC timestamp. Map it directly to Calendar start and use addMinutes(1.scheduledAt; ifempty(1.durationMinutes; 30)) for end; do not parse or concatenate separate date/time fields."
                               ],
                     "designer":  {
                                      "orphans":  [

                                                  ]
                                  }
                 },
    "flow":  [
                 {
                     "id":  1,
                     "module":  "gateway:CustomWebHook",
                     "version":  1,
                     "parameters":  {
                                        "hook":  0,
                                        "maxResults":  1
                                    },
                     "mapper":  {

                                },
                     "metadata":  {
                                      "designer":  {
                                                       "x":  -300,
                                                       "y":  300
                                                   },
                                      "restore":  {
                                                      "parameters":  {
                                                                         "hook":  {
                                                                                      "data":  {
                                                                                                   "editable":  "true"
                                                                                               }
                                                                                  }
                                                                     }
                                                  },
                                      "notes":  "Create a new custom webhook for this scenario. Set its URL as MAKE_WEBHOOK_URL_INTERVIEW_PIPELINE. Do not reuse the generic orchestrator or staff-alert webhook."
                                  }
                 },
                 {
                     "id":  2,
                     "module":  "builtin:BasicRouter",
                     "version":  1,
                     "mapper":  null,
                     "metadata":  {
                                      "designer":  {
                                                       "x":  0,
                                                       "y":  300
                                                   }
                                  },
                     "routes":  [
                                    {
                                        "flow":  [
                                                     {
                                                         "id":  3,
                                                         "module":  "google-calendar:createAnEvent",
                                                         "version":  5,
                                                         "parameters":  {
                                                                            "__IMTCONN__":  ""
                                                                        },
                                                         "mapper":  {
                                                                        "select":  "detail",
                                                                        "calendar":  "primary",
                                                                        "summary":  "Interview with {{1.candidateName}} - At The Agency",
                                                                        "allDayEvent":  false,
                                                                        "start":  "{{1.scheduledAt}}",
                                                                        "end":  "{{addMinutes(1.scheduledAt; ifempty(1.durationMinutes; 30))}}",
                                                                        "description":  "At The Agency interview\nInterview ID: {{1.interviewId}}\nFormat: {{1.interviewMode}}\nApplication ID: {{1.applicationId}}\n{{ifempty(1.meetingUrl; \"\")}}",
                                                                        "location":  "{{if(1.interviewMode = \"in_person\"; \"At The Agency\"; ifempty(1.meetingUrl; \"\"))}}",
                                                                        "attendees":  [
                                                                                          {
                                                                                              "email":  "{{1.to}}",
                                                                                              "displayName":  "{{1.candidateName}}"
                                                                                          }
                                                                                      ],
                                                                        "transparency":  "opaque",
                                                                        "visibility":  "private",
                                                                        "sendUpdates":  "all",
                                                                        "guestsCanModify":  false
                                                                    },
                                                         "metadata":  {
                                                                          "designer":  {
                                                                                           "x":  300,
                                                                                           "y":  0
                                                                                       },
                                                                          "restore":  {
                                                                                          "expect":  {
                                                                                                         "select":  {
                                                                                                                        "label":  "In Detail"
                                                                                                                    },
                                                                                                         "calendar":  {
                                                                                                                          "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                          "label":  "Select the agency calendar after import"
                                                                                                                      },
                                                                                                         "visibility":  {
                                                                                                                            "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                            "label":  "Private"
                                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                         "sendUpdates":  {
                                                                                                                             "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                             "label":  "All"
                                                                                                                         }
                                                                                                     },
                                                                                          "parameters":  {
                                                                                                             "__IMTCONN__":  {
                                                                                                                                 "data":  {
                                                                                                                                              "scoped":  "true",
                                                                                                                                              "connection":  "google"
                                                                                                                                          }
                                                                                                                             }
                                                                                                         }
                                                                                      },
                                                                          "notes":  "Connect the agency Google account and select the calendar. Calendar invitations go to the candidate email supplied by the website. For video interviews, include a verified meetingUrl in the website record; the Calendar module\u0027s conferencing output is used only when it provides one."
                                                                      }
                                                     },
                                                     {
                                                         "id":  4,
                                                         "module":  "google-sheets:addRow",
                                                         "version":  2,
                                                         "parameters":  {
                                                                            "__IMTCONN__":  ""
                                                                        },
                                                         "mapper":  {
                                                                        "from":  "drive",
                                                                        "mode":  "select",
                                                                        "spreadsheetId":  "REPLACE_AFTER_IMPORT",
                                                                        "sheetId":  "Interviews",
                                                                        "includesHeaders":  true,
                                                                        "insertDataOption":  "INSERT_ROWS",
                                                                        "useColumnHeaders":  false,
                                                                        "valueInputOption":  "USER_ENTERED",
                                                                        "values":  {
                                                                                       "0":  "{{1.interviewId}}",
                                                                                       "1":  "{{1.applicationId}}",
                                                                                       "2":  "{{1.candidateName}}",
                                                                                       "3":  "{{1.to}}",
                                                                                       "4":  "{{1.scheduledDate}}",
                                                                                       "5":  "{{1.scheduledTime24}}",
                                                                                       "6":  "{{1.interviewMode}}",
                                                                                       "7":  "{{3.hangoutLink}}",
                                                                                       "8":  "{{3.id}}",
                                                                                       "9":  "{{3.htmlLink}}",
                                                                                       "10":  "SCHEDULED"
                                                                                   }
                                                                    },
                                                         "metadata":  {
                                                                          "designer":  {
                                                                                           "x":  600,
                                                                                           "y":  0
                                                                                       },
                                                                          "restore":  {
                                                                                          "expect":  {
                                                                                                         "from":  {
                                                                                                                      "label":  "My Drive"
                                                                                                                  },
                                                                                                         "mode":  {
                                                                                                                      "label":  "Select from the list"
                                                                                                                  },
                                                                                                         "sheetId":  {
                                                                                                                         "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                         "label":  "Interviews"
                                                                                                                     }
                                                                                                     },
                                                                                          "parameters":  {
                                                                                                             "__IMTCONN__":  {
                                                                                                                                 "data":  {
                                                                                                                                              "scoped":  "true",
                                                                                                                                              "connection":  "google"
                                                                                                                                          }
                                                                                                                             }
                                                                                                         }
                                                                                      },
                                                                          "notes":  "Create an Interviews tab with the eleven headers listed in make/SCENARIOS-TO-IMPORT.md, then select it here. Restrict access to authorized agency staff."
                                                                      }
                                                     },
                                                     {
                                                         "id":  5,
                                                         "module":  "gateway:WebhookRespond",
                                                         "version":  1,
                                                         "parameters":  {

                                                                        },
                                                         "mapper":  {
                                                                        "body":  "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"interviewId\": \"{{1.interviewId}}\",\n  \"eventId\": \"{{3.id}}\",\n  \"eventUrl\": \"{{3.htmlLink}}\",\n  \"meetLink\": \"{{ifempty(3.hangoutLink; 1.meetingUrl)}}\",\n  \"sheetRowNumber\": {{4.rowNumber}}\n}",
                                                                        "status":  "200"
                                                                    },
                                                         "metadata":  {
                                                                          "designer":  {
                                                                                           "x":  900,
                                                                                           "y":  0
                                                                                       },
                                                                          "restore":  {

                                                                                      },
                                                                          "notes":  "The Worker stores eventId and sheetRowNumber on the interview. Those references are supplied on reschedule so the update route reuses the existing event and row."
                                                                      }
                                                     }
                                                 ],
                                        "filter":  {
                                                       "name":  "New interview",
                                                       "conditions":  [
                                                                          [
                                                                              {
                                                                                  "a":  "{{1.calendarEventId}}",
                                                                                  "b":  "",
                                                                                  "o":  "text:equal:ci"
                                                                              }
                                                                          ]
                                                                      ]
                                                   }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "flow":  [
                                                     {
                                                         "id":  6,
                                                         "module":  "google-calendar:updateAnEvent",
                                                         "version":  5,
                                                         "parameters":  {
                                                                            "__IMTCONN__":  ""
                                                                        },
                                                         "mapper":  {
                                                                        "event":  "{{1.calendarEventId}}",
                                                                        "calendar":  "primary",
                                                                        "summary":  "Interview with {{1.candidateName}} - At The Agency",
                                                                        "allDayEvent":  false,
                                                                        "start":  "{{1.scheduledAt}}",
                                                                        "end":  "{{addMinutes(1.scheduledAt; ifempty(1.durationMinutes; 30))}}",
                                                                        "description":  "At The Agency interview\nInterview ID: {{1.interviewId}}\nFormat: {{1.interviewMode}}\nApplication ID: {{1.applicationId}}\n{{ifempty(1.meetingUrl; \"\")}}",
                                                                        "location":  "{{if(1.interviewMode = \"in_person\"; \"At The Agency\"; ifempty(1.meetingUrl; \"\"))}}",
                                                                        "attendees":  [
                                                                                          {
                                                                                              "email":  "{{1.to}}",
                                                                                              "displayName":  "{{1.candidateName}}"
                                                                                          }
                                                                                      ],
                                                                        "transparency":  "opaque",
                                                                        "visibility":  "private",
                                                                        "sendUpdates":  "all",
                                                                        "guestsCanModify":  false
                                                                    },
                                                         "metadata":  {
                                                                          "designer":  {
                                                                                           "x":  300,
                                                                                           "y":  600
                                                                                       },
                                                                          "restore":  {
                                                                                          "expect":  {
                                                                                                         "calendar":  {
                                                                                                                          "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                          "label":  "Select the agency calendar after import"
                                                                                                                      },
                                                                                                         "event":  {
                                                                                                                       "mode":  "edit"
                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                         "visibility":  {
                                                                                                                            "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                            "label":  "Private"
                                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                         "sendUpdates":  {
                                                                                                                             "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                             "label":  "All"
                                                                                                                         }
                                                                                                     },
                                                                                          "parameters":  {
                                                                                                             "__IMTCONN__":  {
                                                                                                                                 "data":  {
                                                                                                                                              "scoped":  "true",
                                                                                                                                              "connection":  "google"
                                                                                                                                          }
                                                                                                                             }
                                                                                                         }
                                                                                      },
                                                                          "notes":  "Update the saved event and send the calendar change to its guest. The stable event id comes from the website\u0027s interview record."
                                                                      }
                                                     },
                                                     {
                                                         "id":  10,
                                                         "module":  "google-sheets:updateRow",
                                                         "version":  2,
                                                         "parameters":  {
                                                                            "__IMTCONN__":  ""
                                                                        },
                                                         "mapper":  {
                                                                        "from":  "drive",
                                                                        "mode":  "select",
                                                                        "spreadsheetId":  "REPLACE_AFTER_IMPORT",
                                                                        "sheetId":  "Interviews",
                                                                        "includesHeaders":  true,
                                                                        "rowNumber":  "{{1.sheetRowNumber}}",
                                                                        "useColumnHeaders":  false,
                                                                        "valueInputOption":  "USER_ENTERED",
                                                                        "values":  {
                                                                                       "0":  "{{1.interviewId}}",
                                                                                       "1":  "{{1.applicationId}}",
                                                                                       "2":  "{{1.candidateName}}",
                                                                                       "3":  "{{1.to}}",
                                                                                       "4":  "{{1.scheduledDate}}",
                                                                                       "5":  "{{1.scheduledTime24}}",
                                                                                       "6":  "{{1.interviewMode}}",
                                                                                       "7":  "{{ifempty(6.hangoutLink; 1.meetingUrl)}}",
                                                                                       "8":  "{{6.id}}",
                                                                                       "9":  "{{6.htmlLink}}",
                                                                                       "10":  "RESCHEDULED"
                                                                                   }
                                                                    },
                                                         "metadata":  {
                                                                          "designer":  {
                                                                                           "x":  600,
                                                                                           "y":  600
                                                                                       },
                                                                          "restore":  {
                                                                                          "expect":  {
                                                                                                         "from":  {
                                                                                                                      "label":  "My Drive"
                                                                                                                  },
                                                                                                         "mode":  {
                                                                                                                      "label":  "Select from the list"
                                                                                                                  },
                                                                                                         "sheetId":  {
                                                                                                                         "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                         "label":  "Interviews"
                                                                                                                     }
                                                                                                     },
                                                                                          "parameters":  {
                                                                                                             "__IMTCONN__":  {
                                                                                                                                 "data":  {
                                                                                                                                              "scoped":  "true",
                                                                                                                                              "connection":  "google"
                                                                                                                                          }
                                                                                                                             }
                                                                                                         }
                                                                                      },
                                                                          "notes":  "Update the same sheet row using the saved row number; do not add a second row on reschedule."
                                                                      }
                                                     },
                                                     {
                                                         "id":  11,
                                                         "module":  "gateway:WebhookRespond",
                                                         "version":  1,
                                                         "parameters":  {

                                                                        },
                                                         "mapper":  {
                                                                        "body":  "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"interviewId\": \"{{1.interviewId}}\",\n  \"eventId\": \"{{6.id}}\",\n  \"eventUrl\": \"{{6.htmlLink}}\",\n  \"meetLink\": \"{{ifempty(6.hangoutLink; 1.meetingUrl)}}\",\n  \"sheetRowNumber\": {{1.sheetRowNumber}}\n}",
                                                                        "status":  "200"
                                                                    },
                                                         "metadata":  {
                                                                          "designer":  {
                                                                                           "x":  900,
                                                                                           "y":  600
                                                                                       },
                                                                          "restore":  {

                                                                                      },
                                                                          "notes":  "Return the row found by Interview ID; the Worker stores this stable Calendar event and sheet row reference for later reschedules."
                                                                      }
                                                     }
                                                 ],
                                        "filter":  {
                                                       "name":  "Reschedule existing interview",
                                                       "conditions":  [
                                                                          [
                                                                              {
                                                                                  "a":  "{{1.calendarEventId}}",
                                                                                  "b":  "",
                                                                                  "o":  "text:notequal:ci"
                                                                              }
                                                                          ]
                                                                      ]
                                                   }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "flow":  [
                                                     {
                                                         "id":  12,
                                                         "module":  "google-calendar:updateAnEvent",
                                                         "version":  5,
                                                         "parameters":  {
                                                                            "__IMTCONN__":  ""
                                                                        },
                                                         "mapper":  {
                                                                        "event":  "{{1.calendarEventId}}",
                                                                        "calendar":  "primary",
                                                                        "summary":  "Interview with {{1.candidateName}} - At The Agency",
                                                                        "allDayEvent":  false,
                                                                        "start":  "{{1.scheduledAt}}",
                                                                        "end":  "{{addMinutes(1.scheduledAt; ifempty(1.durationMinutes; 30))}}",
                                                                        "description":  "At The Agency interview\nInterview ID: {{1.interviewId}}\nFormat: {{1.interviewMode}}\nApplication ID: {{1.applicationId}}\n{{ifempty(1.meetingUrl; \"\")}}",
                                                                        "location":  "{{if(1.interviewMode = \"in_person\"; \"At The Agency\"; ifempty(1.meetingUrl; \"\"))}}",
                                                                        "attendees":  [
                                                                                          {
                                                                                              "email":  "{{1.to}}",
                                                                                              "displayName":  "{{1.candidateName}}"
                                                                                          }
                                                                                      ],
                                                                        "transparency":  "opaque",
                                                                        "visibility":  "private",
                                                                        "sendUpdates":  "all",
                                                                        "guestsCanModify":  false
                                                                    },
                                                         "metadata":  {
                                                                          "designer":  {
                                                                                           "x":  300,
                                                                                           "y":  1050
                                                                                       },
                                                                          "restore":  {
                                                                                          "expect":  {
                                                                                                         "calendar":  {
                                                                                                                          "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                          "label":  "Select the agency calendar after import"
                                                                                                                      },
                                                                                                         "event":  {
                                                                                                                       "mode":  "edit"
                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                         "visibility":  {
                                                                                                                            "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                            "label":  "Private"
                                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                         "sendUpdates":  {
                                                                                                                             "mode":  "chose",
                                                                                                                             "label":  "All"
                                                                                                                         }
                                                                                                     },
                                                                                          "parameters":  {
                                                                                                             "__IMTCONN__":  {
                                                                                                                                 "data":  {
                                                                                                                                              "scoped":  "true",
                                                                                                                                              "connection":  "google"
                                                                                                                                          }
                                                                                                                             }
                                                                                                         }
                                                                                      },
                                                                          "notes":  "Update the saved event and send the calendar change to its guest. The stable event id comes from the website\u0027s interview record."
                                                                      }
                                                     },
                                                     {
                                                         "id":  13,
                                                         "module":  "gateway:WebhookRespond",
                                                         "version":  1,
                                                         "parameters":  {

                                                                        },
                                                         "mapper":  {
                                                                        "body":  "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"interviewId\": \"{{1.interviewId}}\",\n  \"eventId\": \"{{12.id}}\",\n  \"eventUrl\": \"{{12.htmlLink}}\",\n  \"meetLink\": \"{{ifempty(12.hangoutLink; 1.meetingUrl)}}\",\n  \"sheetRowNumber\": null\n}",
                                                                        "status":  "200"
                                                                    },
                                                         "metadata":  {
                                                                          "designer":  {
                                                                                           "x":  600,
                                                                                           "y":  1050
                                                                                       },
                                                                          "restore":  {

                                                                                      },
                                                                          "notes":  "Return the updated event reference. This legacy interview has no saved sheet row."
                                                                      }
                                                     }
                                                 ],
                                        "filter":  {
                                                       "name":  "Reschedule event without sheet row",
                                                       "conditions":  [
                                                                          [
                                                                              {
                                                                                  "a":  "{{1.calendarEventId}}",
                                                                                  "b":  "",
                                                                                  "o":  "text:notequal:ci"
                                                                              },
                                                                              {
                                                                                  "a":  "{{1.sheetRowNumber}}",
                                                                                  "b":  "",
                                                                                  "o":  "text:equal:ci"
                                                                              }
                                                                          ]
                                                                      ]
                                                   }
                                    }
                                ]
                 }
             ]
}